      "sequence_position": 7,
      "problem": "Let $p=⟨-1,1,1⟩$ and $q=⟨4,8,2⟩.$ Find the vector projection of $q$ onto $p.$\n\n${\\text{proj}}_{p}\\,q=⟨$  \n\n{{field-1}},\n\n{{field-2}},\n\n{{field-3}}\n\n$⟩$",
